    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36116" root="قلخ" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَلْخٌ</span></b>  A stallion-camel <i>excited by lust,</i> (K, TA,)
<i>when he is</i> [<i>braying vehemently, as though</i>] <i>pulling out the sound of braying</i> [<i>from his chest:</i>
see 1]. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>An ass</i> [app. <i>a wild ass</i>]
<i>advanced in age:</i> (K, TA:) and so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَلْحٌ</span>; with
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ح</span> as well as with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خ</span>. (TA; and K in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قلح</span>.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Also, [or perhaps <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَصَبٌ قَلْخٌ</span>,] <i>Hollow reeds</i>
or <i>canes.</i> (K.)

